{%- comment -%}
  Pico the mascot — a gentle cursor follower.
  Renders a small Pico that eases toward the pointer a beat behind the real cursor.
  Self-contained: inline SVG + CSS + JS. Rendered once from layout/theme.liquid.

  Why: adds a soft, playful brand moment that fits the kids/soft-natural aesthetic
  without replacing the native cursor (so buttons/links still read as clickable).

  Behaviour:
    - Only runs on devices with a fine pointer (a real mouse) — skipped on touch.
    - Respects prefers-reduced-motion: the follower stays off for those users.
    - pointer-events: none so it never blocks clicks.
{%- endcomment -%}

